ProductResource ..> ProductResponses
ModerationResource ..> ProductResponses
ProductResponses ..> InventoryService : stockOf (em saved e batch, a falha\nvira o estado gravado, sem OUT_OF_STOCK)
ProductResponses ..> ProductActions : eligibility (uma por página) e of
ProductResponses ..> ETags
ProductResponses ..> Cursors
Cursors ..> Page
ProductResource ..> ETags
ProductResource ..> Cursors
ProductResource ..> QueryParams

OpenApiDescriptions ..|> OASFilter
ProblemMappers ..> Problem : produz
Problem "1" *-- "0..*" FieldError : errors
Problem "1" *-- "0..*" ReasonDetail : reasonDetails
ProblemMappers ..> ReasonMessages : texto dos motivos
ReasonMessages ..> ReasonDetail : produz
ProblemMappers ..> NullCharacterGuard : rejectedField

note right of ProblemMappers
  |= Exceção |= Status |= type |
  | NotFoundException | 404 | not-found |
  | DuplicateException | 409 | code da exceção |
  | ConcurrentUpdateException | 409 | concurrent-update |
  | VersionMismatchException | 412 | version-mismatch |
  | PreconditionRequiredException | 428 | precondition-required |
  | InvalidTransitionException, ReservationRefusal, StockConflictException,\nCategoryNotEmptyException | 409 | code da exceção |
  | DomainRuleViolation | 422 | code da exceção |
  | AccessDeniedException | 403 | access-denied |
  | TenantNotAuthorizedException | 403 | tenant-not-authorized |
  | InvalidInputException | 400 | invalid-request |
  | InvalidImportFileException | 400 | invalid-import-file |
  | ConstraintViolationException | 400 | validation-failed |
  | MismatchedInputException de U+0000 em texto do corpo (NullCharacterGuard) | 400 | validation-failed |
  | JsonProcessingException, demais MismatchedInputException | 400 | malformed-body |
  | WebApplicationException 400 com causa JSON | 400 | malformed-body |
  | TimeoutException (Mutiny) | 503 + Retry-After: 1 | service-unavailable |
  | WebApplicationException (demais) | status original | http-{status} |
  | Exception | 500 | internal-error |
  Na família DomainRuleViolation e em InvalidImportFileException,
  reasonDetails traz cada motivo com o texto: o do emissor, quando ele
  escreveu, ou o do catálogo de mensagens com os parâmetros.
end note

note bottom of ETags
  ETags: todos os resources autenticados, menos ProductImportResource,
  StoreEligibilityResource, StatsResource e SessionResource. Cursors: Product,
  Moderation, Category e ProductImport. QueryParams: Product, Category e Stats. As setas de uso estão só em ProductResource;
  ModerationResource e CategoryResource usam os mesmos apoios.
end note

note as ROLES
  Todos os resources são @Traced(entry = true). Cada endpoint exige capacidades com
  @PermissionsAllowed (nomes de security.Capabilities; basta uma), e o papel que dá cada uma
  fica só em security.CallerContext. Leitura de produto, oferta e estoque: MANAGE_OWN_PRODUCTS,
  READ_TENANT_CATALOG ou MODERATE_PRODUCTS; leitura de categoria: essas e MANAGE_TAXONOMY;
  escrita de produto, oferta, estoque e importação: MANAGE_OWN_PRODUCTS; escrita de categoria:
  MANAGE_TAXONOMY; ModerationResource: MODERATE_PRODUCTS; ModerationReasonResource: leitura dos
  ativos com MODERATE_PRODUCTS ou MANAGE_MODERATION_REASONS, inativos e escrita com
  MANAGE_MODERATION_REASONS; ReservationResource: MANAGE_RESERVATIONS; StoreEligibilityResource:
  MANAGE_OWN_PRODUCTS (a própria loja) ou READ_SELLER_ELIGIBILITY (catalog-admin e catalog-moderator);
  StatsResource: MANAGE_OWN_PRODUCTS (/store), MODERATE_PRODUCTS (/moderation e /moderation/queue)
  e MANAGE_TAXONOMY (/categories);
  SessionResource: qualquer usuário autenticado (@Authenticated; papel desconhecido sai sem
  capacidades); StorefrontResource: anônimo (@PermitAll),
  estoque lido do banco e produto com ofertas via cache.StorefrontCache.
  Colaboradores de outros pacotes: security.CallerContext, config.CatalogConfig,
  observability.Lifecycle e InventoryLatency, cache.StorefrontCache, observability.Correlation
  (CorrelationFilter) e observability.Telemetry.problem (ProblemMappers).
end note
ProductResponses -[hidden]down- ROLES

legend right
